[49.078, "o", "\u001b[1;18H\u001b[1mTimeline\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\nFix request timeout without hiding errors.\r\n  Working directory: /fixture/project\u001b[K\r\n  Exit status: 1\u001b[K\r\n  Output:     --- FAIL: TestRetryTimeout (0.03s)\u001b[6;18H\u001b[1K retry_test.go:42: expected deadline exceeded; got request co\u001b[K\u001b[7;18H\u001b[1K mpleted after caller cancellation; request_id=fixture-00017;\u001b[8;19H\u001b[1K attempt=3; timeout=3000ms\u001b[K\u001b[9;14H\u001b[1K FAIL example.invalid/project/internal/client\u001b[K\r\n  Enter to hide details\u001b[K\r\n\n\u001b[1m  #4 + Command \u00b7 RESULT UNAVAILABLE \u00b7 go build ./...\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\n  #5 + Command \u00b7 recorded exit 0 \u00b7 go build ./...\r\n\n\u001b[1m> #6 + Unsupported session activity \u00b7 future_activity\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[1m  \u256d\u2500 Assistant\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1mThe build passed. No later successful run of the failed test is recorded.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u2570\u2500\r\n\nEnd of timeline \u00b7 8 events loaded\r\nTarget: #6 \u00b7 + closed \u00b7 Index: complete\n\u001b[4Gread \u00b7 [] events \u00b7 Enter expand \u00b7 d inspect \u00b7 Esc \u00b7 ? help"]
